            <div xml:id="ch41">

                <pb facs="0465" n="381" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg381"/>

                <head>Supplementary convention between the United States and Cuba, extending the
                    time within which above commercial convention may have ratifications
                    exchanged</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, January 26, 1903.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, February 16, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        March 30, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by Cuba, March 30, 1903.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, March 31, 1903.<lb/>Proclaimed, December 17,
                        1903.</hi></p>

